       corresponding  shift sequence at _*_o_u_t_b_u_f.  At most _*_o_u_t_b_y_t_e_s_l_e_f_t bytes,
       starting at _*_o_u_t_b_u_f, will be written.  If the output buffer has no more
       room for this reset sequence,  it  sets  _e_r_r_n_o  to  EE22BBIIGG  and  returns
