       EE22BBIIGG  There is not sufficient room at _*_o_u_t_b_u_f.

       EEIILLSSEEQQ An invalid multibyte sequence has been encountered in the input.

       EEIINNVVAALL An incomplete multibyte sequence has been encountered in the in‐
